//! AudioCaps C ABI.
//!
//! This crate builds the shared library (`libaudiocaps.so`) that applications bundle, with a C
//! header generated by cbindgen. The ABI arrives in phase 9; until then the crate only fixes the
//! boundary: the C ABI depends on the model and backends, never the other way round.

